ENQ20, DEQ 5, then ENQ4
=======================

Expected:
=========
it enqueues max 10, then gives errors for next 10 as queue full, but next deques 5, makes 
next 4 enque successfully.
Actual Result:
==============
same as expected.

Observation:
------------
Further, it is observed that during the Queue full time, that is all while Enq erroring out,
we see packet drops (ENQ error, cant enque messages indicate dropped packtes). 
But when Dequeue runs, it makes space for more packets and new packets from pktid:21 keep
getting enqueued again.

Inference:
----------
The Dequeue rate should be as fast as enqueue rate for
accuartely reciving all data, i.e for NO or MINIMAL packet drops

